SUMMARY:🎬$5.99  Friday Classic Movie : Good Will Hunting 🎬
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n**🎬 
 Friday Movie Meetup: *Good Will Hunting* 🎬**\nJoin us for a special big
 -screen showing of the classic film *Good Will Hunting* at **Imagine Cinem
 as Carlton** — all for just **$5.99!**\n\n***\n\n**🗓 Date:** Friday\,
  April 24\n**🕡 Showtime:** 6:40 PM\n**📍 Location:** Auditorium #4\n
 👋 **Meetup Details:**\nLook for **Nick with a Meetup sign** outside Aud
 itorium #4 before and after the movie. Feel free to say hi\, chat about th
 e film\, and meet fellow movie lovers!\n\n***\n\n**🎥 Movie:** *Good Wil
 l Hunting*\\*\\*\n**⏱ Runtime:** 2 hours 6 minutes\n\n***\n\n**📝 Movi
 e Description:**\nThis powerful drama follows Will Hunting\, a brilliant b
 ut troubled young janitor at MIT who solves complex math problems in secre
 t. When his talent is discovered\, he’s pushed to confront his past with
  the help of a compassionate therapist. What unfolds is a deeply human sto
 ry about genius\, friendship\, and finding your place in the world.\n\n***
 \n\n**⭐ Why This Movie Is Special:**\n\n* Academy Award-winning screenpl
 ay by Matt Damon and Ben Affleck\n* Features an unforgettable\, Oscar-winn
 ing performance by Robin Williams\n* A rare mix of emotional depth\, humor
 \, and inspiring character growth\n* One of the most beloved films of the 
 1990s — even decades later\, it still resonates\n\n***\n\n**🎞 Watch t
 he Trailer:** [https://youtu.be/PaZVjZEFkRs?si=6YxMIzvWGlw9LMud](https://y
 outu.be/PaZVjZEFkRs?si=6YxMIzvWGlw9LMud)\n\n***\n\n**🎟 Grab Your Ticket
 :**\nSecure your seat here:\n👉 [https://omniwebticketing6.com/imagineci
 nemas/carlton/?schdate=2026-04-24&perfix=134633](https://omniwebticketing6
 .com/imaginecinemas/carlton/?schdate=2026-04-24&perfix=134633)\n\n***\n\n
 💬 Whether you’ve seen it before or it’s your first time\, this is a
  perfect chance to experience *Good Will Hunting* on the big screen with a
  great group. You can also just show up if you're unsure of your schedule 
 — we’d love to have you!
